Compliant Solution
    
    
    class MyClass {
      private static final Map<String, String> MY_MAP = new HashMap<String, String>();
    
      static {
        MY_MAP.put("a", "b");
      }
    }
    

or using Java 9 `Map.of`:
    
    
    class MyClass {
      // Compliant
      private static final Map<String, String> MY_MAP = java.util.Map.of("a", "b");
    }
    

